  "2026-10-24T00:34:12.671Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: live PR1569 search returned0 and current open/in_progress lists were read after the complete strict3091-item corpus. Original owners pm-gh1563 and pm-gh1564 are closed with full metadata and verified history; this distinct review-test delta is a child of the canonical SDK option owner. Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1569#discussion_r4365313003. No runtime regression is asserted."
  "2026-10-24T00:35:50.216Z","harness:codex","Review assessment: accepted the concrete test gap and now create a real matching item with valid forward selectors and close reason. Each invalid input must preserve the complete item and exact history after both rejections. Added concise safety-contract docstrings to six touched private writers. The grouped dependency remediation remains required by the user request and existing zero-advisory gate; splitting it is not adopted. Sourcery quota and expired Greptile review access are provider limitations rather than approval. The missing deferred-toolchain graph edges are recorded through PM and the unchanged graph/record-integrity providers and bounded mutation gate pass."
